{
  "id": "explore-reading-and-understanding-a-dashboard-collapse-and-expand-a-row",
  "title": "Collapse and expand a row",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Explore the rows on Demo Wind Farm to see which panels each row groups together and how a row's heading stays visible when its contents are hidden."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "rows",
      "title": "Rows on Demo Wind Farm",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "navigate",
          "reftarget": "/d/avzwehmz/demo-wind-farm?from=now-12h&to=now&timezone=browser&var-AssetID=e64c9075-9d89-47cb-8ee5-d3251bd253f4",
          "content": "Open the **Demo Wind Farm** dashboard."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "button:has([data-testid='data-testid dashboard-row-title-Wind Farm Power'])",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/d/avzwehmz",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "content": "Focus on the **Wind Farm Power** row heading.",
          "doIt": false,
          "lazyRender": true
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": "This row groups a time series panel and a stat panel. A row can hold different types of panels. Its heading tells you what the panels cover before you read them."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "button:has([data-testid='data-testid dashboard-row-title-Wind Farm Power'])",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/d/avzwehmz",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "content": "Select the **Wind Farm Power** arrow to collapse the row."
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": "The row's panels are hidden. The heading stays visible so you can expand the row again. Collapsing and expanding rows lets any viewer control what they see."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "button:has([data-testid='data-testid dashboard-row-title-Wind Farm Power'])",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/d/avzwehmz",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "content": "Select the **Wind Farm Power** arrow again to expand the row."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "button:has([data-testid^='data-testid dashboard-row-title-Asset:'])",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/d/avzwehmz",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "content": "Find the row heading that starts with **Asset:**.",
          "doIt": false,
          "lazyRender": true
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "div[data-testid^='data-testid dashboard-row-wrapper-for-Asset:']",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/d/avzwehmz",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "content": "Take note that there are five panels using different formats.",
          "doIt": false,
          "lazyRender": true
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "button:has([data-testid='data-testid dashboard-row-title-Alerts'])",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/d/avzwehmz",
